5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all. Let's try our best to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"...Hello. I'll do my best, but I'm not very good at these things.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's keep this logical. We have no information yet, so we should observe speech patterns.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us be kind to one another while we solve this mystery.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. A harmonious atmosphere will help us think more clearly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you seem very serious! I'll rely on your logic to help us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"I simply prefer efficiency. For now, we should avoid making baseless accusations.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very wise suggestion, Asuka.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I'll just listen for now and see if anyone seems out of place.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
