31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, I have something important to say! I'm the Seer, and I checked Asuka. She is the werewolf!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,What? Already? I... I can't believe it.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"That is a very bold claim for the first day. Yumi, are you trying to frame me to secure an early win?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, such a shocking start. Are you certain, dear Yumi?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"This is very sudden. If Yumi is the Seer, we should listen, but we must be careful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm absolutely sure! The vision was very clear. We have to vote for Asuka today!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,But... what if Yumi is the werewolf and is lying to get rid of Asuka?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Exactly. A real Seer might stay hidden to avoid being attacked tonight. Yumi's reveal is too reckless.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a difficult position. Yumi seems so sincere, but Asuka's point is logical.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, why did you decide to tell us immediately instead of waiting?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Because I didn't want the werewolf to kill anyone else! I wanted to save the village right now!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I believe Yumi. She doesn't seem like she's lying.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Emotional appeals are not evidence. I am a villager, and Yumi is manipulating you.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel a bit of tension. Let's think about who is more likely to be telling the truth.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"If we execute Asuka and she's innocent, we lose a valuable person. But if we keep a werewolf, we lose someone every night.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Please trust me! Let's vote for Asuka!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll trust Yumi.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,This is a mistake. You are all being led by a child's enthusiasm.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I believe in Yumi's kindness. I will vote for Asuka.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm leaning toward Yumi as well. Her energy feels honest.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
